================================================================================
Dependencies
================================================================================

This component is OpenAPI build tooling. Its `artifact-metadata.json` declares
`"artifact_type": "none"` — it produces no container image, binary, chart or
package. It merges and lints OpenAPI specifications at build time; the merged
specification it emits is NVIDIA-authored content, not a derivative of the
tools that produced it.

The npm packages it invokes (`@redocly/cli`, `openapi-merge-cli` and their
transitive dependencies) are build-time tooling only. They are never bundled
into any distributed artifact, so they are not attributable here. Each is
obtained from the public npm registry under its own license at build time.
